            "Society discussed the problems",
            "The crowd problems were solved"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "toplum is society, toplumsal is social. tartışıldı is passive: were discussed."
        },
        {
          "id": "4",
          "prompt": "Doğal ürünler satıldı.",
          "say": "Doğal ürünler satıldı.",
          "options": [
            "Natural products were sold",
            "The products were sold outdoors",
            "No products were sold"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "doğa is nature, doğal is natural. A word from the no-s list."
        }
      ]
    },
